WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.167
STEPHANIE WONG: Get ready,
because Google Cloud Next

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.650
starts today on a
virtual screen near you.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.840
Yes, that means you can
keep your sweats on.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.330
And we're going to start each
morning with a live broadcast

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.110
and keynote.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.060
There will be two channels to
join that play simultaneously,

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.580
so feel free to
switch between them.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.670
It's up to you to explore our
live interactive expert Q&amp;As,

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.380
breakout sessions, and demos.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.660
Check out our expert
playlists, including mine,

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.240
or make your own
at g.co/cloud/next.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.730
As for day one, check
out the opening keynote.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.257
Our CEO, Thomas
Kurian, will talk

00:00:28.257 --> 00:00:30.090
about how our products
have helped customers

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.220
adapt to complexities
and challenges

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.780
and lead to opportunities.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.160
I can't reveal
too much just yet,

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.080
but expect to hear about
our biggest launches,

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.110
captivating customer stories,
and TK's view on Google Cloud's

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:40.840
feature.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.650
Keep an eye out for some
exciting cameos, as well.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.990
Then join me in my
keynote, "Data Cloud,

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.510
Simply transform with a
universal data platform."

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.120
VP of databases and
analytics joins me

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.000
as we introduce the future
of data, analytics, and AI

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.900
at Google Cloud.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.040
We'll highlight our latest
technology for products,

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.970
including BigQuery, Spanner,
Looker, and Vertex AI.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.850
And don't miss it, because
there will be a live demo.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.240
Check out the live Q&amp;A
afterwards to interact with us.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.400
Then we'll move into
our Workspace spotlight,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.160
"How it's done with Google
Workspace," where they'll

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.500
announce launches that are
helping customers transform

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.740
collaboration and support
genuine human connection

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.040
in a hybrid world.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.970
And, yes, there will
be a live demo and Q&amp;A.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:24.130
And the day will wrap up with a
spotlight session on diversity,

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.010
equity, and inclusion
to help you build

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:28.620
a safe, inclusive, and
diverse workforce that

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.150
thrives and innovates.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:33.360
Check out channel 2 for
partner-customer innovation

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.540
and DEI spotlights, featuring
our partners like Atos,

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.948
Accenture, and Deloitte.

00:01:37.948 --> 00:01:39.990
I do want to also remind
you that we have a bunch

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:43.680
of interactive events, like Q&amp;As
and learning pathways for cloud

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.750
infrastructure, AI, or security.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.970
And if you're like, hey,
skip all the talking.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.220
I just want to see some
live demo action, then

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.860
filter in the right
filter bar in the catalog

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.780
and you'll find the
sessions with live demos.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.640
Then add them to your
own custom playlist.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.580
OK, so get ready for day
one and connect on social

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.340
by hashtagging
#GoogleCloudNext, and reach out

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.910
to me @stephr_wong.

